※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4677
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4677 LANG_COROUTINE_NOT_WALKED

※ A loop hands nothing in, so a coroutine whose `yield` answers what it is
※ handed is driven with `⎕start` and `⎕resume` and not walked.

fn acc(start: u64) ⇉ u64 ⇇ u64:
    let more := yield start
    yield more

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    let n: mut u64 = 0u64
    foreach v := acc(1u64):
        n ← n + v
    0u6
